---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Recipes | Corbin Fanning">
  <section class="section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Recipes</p>
    <h1>Weekend kitchen notes</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Two recipes I keep coming back to, written in the style of J. Kenji
      López-Alt&apos;s techniques: a pillowy braided challah, and a custardy
      French toast that turns yesterday&apos;s loaf into the best part of
      Sunday morning.
    </p>

    <div class="grid">
      <a class="card recipe-card" href="/recipes/challah">
        <p class="meta">Bread · ~4 hours</p>
        <h3>Braided challah</h3>
        <p>
          Soft, glossy, lightly sweet. Bake one for dinner; turn the leftover
          slices into French toast.
        </p>
        <span class="text-link">View recipe →</span>
      </a>

      <a class="card recipe-card" href="/recipes/french-toast">
        <p class="meta">Breakfast · ~30 minutes</p>
        <h3>Kenji-style French toast</h3>
        <p>
          Thick slices of stale challah, an enriched custard, a long soak,
          and a finishing pass in the oven for a creamy interior.
        </p>
        <span class="text-link">View recipe →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
